  "gloss": {
    "en": "Pluta and pragṛhya vowels remain in their natural form before a following vowel (ac), obligatorily (nitya).",
    "sa": "In saṃhitā, when the left pada is (i) pluta or (ii) pragṛhya, and the next sound begins with a vowel (ac), prakṛtibhāva (no sandhi substitution) is obligatory at that boundary; this blocks subsequent vowel-sandhi substitutions (e.g., 6.1.78, 6.1.87, 6.1.88)."
  },
